# carrilloapps/skills — .gitignore
# Agent skills (Markdown + multi-OS scripts) and optional integrations. Nothing is built here.
# Shared skill state under .memory/<skill>/ and the Docker lab under .memory/devsecops/ ARE versioned;
# only agent-private paths are ignored (see the Skill state section and .memory/.gitignore).

# ─── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# macOS
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Linux
*~

# Windows download marks copied through WSL / \wsl$ (NTFS alternate data streams)
*:Zone.Identifier
*Zone.Identifier

# ─── Editors & IDEs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
*.swp
*.swo
*.orig

# ─── Node / tooling (if build scripts are ever added) ─────────────────────────

node_modules/
# Test fixture that proves lab-probe skips node_modules — it must be committed
!tests/scripts/fixtures/project-node/node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/
.yarn/

# ─── Agent skill installation paths ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Created locally when running: npx skills add ./
# These are installation output — not source. Do not commit.

# Universal / GitHub Copilot / Cursor / Codex / Amp / Gemini CLI / OpenCode / Antigravity
# Only skill installs: .agents/hooks.json, .agents/hooks/ and .agents/rules/ are project config (guards) and stay tracked
.agents/skills/

# Antigravity
.agent/

# Augment
.augment/

# Claude Code — only skill installs; .claude/settings.json and project hooks stay tracked
.claude/skills/

# Cline — only skill installs; .clinerules/ rules and .clinerules/hooks/ (guard) stay tracked
.clinerules/skills/

# CodeBuddy
.codebuddy/

# Command Code
.commandcode/

# Continue
.continue/

# Cortex
.cortex/

# Crush
.crush/

# Droid (Factory AI)
.factory/

# Goose
.goose/

# iFlow CLI
.iflow/

# Junie
.junie/

# Kilo Code
.kilocode/

# Kiro — only skill installs; .kiro/hooks/ (guard) and .kiro/steering/ stay tracked
.kiro/skills/

# Kode
.kode/

# MCPJam
.mcpjam/

# Mistral Vibe
.vibe/

# Mux
.mux/

# OpenClaw (uses root `skills/` directory as its install path)
# NOTE: `skills/` is the monorepo source directory — it must NOT be ignored here.
# If you use OpenClaw locally and it installs into `skills/`, add `skills/` to your
# personal global gitignore (~/.gitignore_global) instead of this file.
# New skills added to skills/<name>/ are tracked source — commit them normally.

# OpenHands
.openhands/

# Pi
.pi/

# Pochi
.pochi/

# Qoder
.qoder/

# Qwen Code
.qwen/

# Roo Code — only skill installs; .roo/rules/ (advisory guard rule) stays tracked
.roo/skills/

# Trae / Trae CN
.trae/
.trae-cn/

# Windsurf — ignore only skill installs; .windsurf/rules/ is project config and should be tracked
.windsurf/skills/

# Zencoder
.zencoder/

# Neovate
.neovate/

# AdaL
.adal/

# ─── GitHub Copilot CLI session state ─────────────────────────────────────────

.copilot/

# ─── Skill state (.memory/) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Selective: shared team state under .memory/<skill>/ is versioned; agent-private
# paths are ignored here and by the versioned .memory/.gitignore that skills create.

.memory/local/
.memory/**/*.local.*
.memory/**/*.recovered.json

# Local index directories of optional capabilities
.codegraph/
.docgraph/

# Parity-test scratch output (also covered by tests/scripts/.gitignore)
tests/scripts/.work/

# ─── Environment — never commit real values ────────────────────────────────────

.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key

# ─── Temporary & logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

*.tmp
*.temp
*.log
*.bak
dist/
build/

# ── agentic-agile artifacts: this repository's choice ────────────────────────
# `specs/` and `plans/` are VERSIONED BY DEFAULT — they are the team's shared
# specs and operating system, and most teams want them in review and history.
# This repository keeps them out of git on purpose: it is a public skill
# catalogue, and its Phase 0 artifacts are a working example, not a product.
# To version them in your project, delete these three lines.
plans/
specs/
